<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">messor</span></b> , ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				reaper</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Cic. de
				Or. 3, 12, 46</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">durus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 14, 643</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">feniseca,</span>”
				<i>a mower</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 2,
					18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dura messorum ilia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 3, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parce messoribus illis qui saturant urbem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					8, 117</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Personified: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus Messor,</span>”
				<i>the god of the harvest</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. G. 1, 21</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>reaper of men</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sator scelerum et messor maxume,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Capt. 3, 5, 3</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt. 13, 30</span></i> and 39.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
